      "rid": "doc_1.src_content.0",
      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "I hope you are well and that by this time things have brightened in regard to your little Mary. I put your letter aside - having noted your favor, for which many thanks, a special Mass at the time - and then lost track of it. I wanted to answer it personally. I surely sympathize with you and your family. We have had quite a few cases similar to little Mary's, the majority of which, thanks be to God, have come through astonishingly well. They sometimes seem miraculous. Glory be to God.",
      "per_polygon": "I hope you are well and that by this time things have brightened in regard to your little Mary. I put your letter aside - having noted your favor, for which many thanks, a special Mass at the time - and then lost track of it, I wanted to answer it personally. I surely sympathize with you and your family. We have had quite a few cases similar to little Mary's, the majority of which, thanks be to God, have come through astonishingly well. They sometimes seem miraculous. Glory be to God.",
